Flamingo: a variant of Open Duck Mini v2, as CadQuery programs

Upstream: Antoine Pirrone and contributors, github.com/apirrone/Open_Duck_Mini (design after Disney's BDX droid; thanks.md there lists the contributors); the Onshape document 64074dfcfa379b37d8a47762.
Licence: Apache-2.0 (LICENSE in this folder), as the Duck's.
The Flamingo is the Duck with longer legs and neck, wings and a bird's head, by Yo.Town 3D. Its parts are
the Duck's programs (robots/open_duck_mini_v2), some run with the Flamingo's values (shared.py), and its
own new parts (the wings, the bird head and the shell that carries them). Bought parts (servos, bearings,
screws, electronics) are not included.
